  keywords = {7996,and,caribbean monk seal,distribution,know virtually nothing due,mammal of which we,monachus tropicalis,monk seal,natural history,pathology,phocidae,pinnipedia,sealing,skull,the west indian or,to its rapid extirpation,was a large},
