  abstract = {Three of the largest Australian Fur Seal Arctocephalus pusillus doriferus colonies lie on islands off the coast of Victoria and, of the 53 seals Melbourne Zoo has received for rehabilitation in the last ten years, most were Australian Fur Seals in varying states of ill-health. 23 seals have so far been released and seven have been resighted. Keeper time represents the programs' greatest expense.},
