  keywords = {6596,Animalia.,Animals. Chordates. Mammals. Nonhuman Mammals. Non,Antarctic Region).,Arctocephalus gazella,Arctocephalus gazella (Otariidae). Arctocephalus t,Arctocephalus tropicalis,Chordata,diet,diet. immobilization.,Digestive System/General,drugging,Ecology,Ecology (Environmental Sciences). Methods and Tech,Environmental Biology/Animal [07508],ketamine hydrochloride: general anesthetic-drug. x,Mammalia,Marion Island (Antarctica,Methods [14001],Nutrition/General Studies,Nutritional Status and Methods [13202],Otariidae [86180],Otariidae: Pinnipedia,Pharmacology/General [22002],stomach lavage,Vertebrata},
