  keywords = {Animals,Artiodactyls,Biochemical Studies/Nucleic Acids,Biochemical Studies/Proteins,Blood,Blood-Forming Organs and Body Fluids/Blood,Bovidae [85715],Bovidae: Artiodactyla,bovine (Bovidae),Cetaceans,Chord,Chorda,Chordat,Chordates,Cytology and Cytochemistry/Animal [02506],Cytology and Cytochemistry/Human [02508],Delphinidae: Cetacea,Genetics and Cytogenetics/Animal [03506],Genetics and Cytogenetics/General [03502],Genetics and Cytogenetics/Human [03508],Hominidae: Primates,human (Hominidae),Humans,immune sys,immune system,Immune System (Chemical Coordination and Homeostas,Immunology and Immunochemistry/General,Mammalia,Mammals,Methods [34502],Molecular Genetics (Biochemistry and Molecular Bio,neutrophil: blood and lymphatics,Nonhuman Mammals,Nonhuman Vertebrates,p40-phos cDNA: NADPH oxidase cytosolic component,p40-phos: NADPH oxidase cytosolic component,p47-phos cDNA: NADPH oxidase cytosolic component,p47-phos: NADPH oxidase cytosolic component,p67-phos cDNA: NADPH oxidase cytosolic component,p67-phos: NADPH oxidase cytosolic component,Peptides and Amino A,Primates,Purines and Pyr,Tursiops truncatus [bottle-nosed dolphin] (Delphin,Vertebrata,Vertebrates,white blood cell mRNA,white blood cell: blood and lymphatics},
