  keywords = {4919,animals. chordates. mammals. nonhuman mammals. non,Antarctica (Antarctic Region).,Chorda,Development. Ecology (Environmental Sciences). Pat,Developmental Biology/Embryology-Morphogenesis,Ecology,Ecology. Mcmurdo Sound. Preweaning Mortality. Pup.,Environmental Biology/Animal [07508],Ge,General and Miscellaneous/Necrosis (197,Leptonychotes weddellii,Leptonychotes weddellii (Phocidae). Weddell seal (,Mammalia,mark-recapture,Pathology,Phocidae [86185],Phocidae: Pinnipedia,population parameters,Vertebrata},
