eproductive success,Reproductive System: Reproduction,Reptilia,sac-winged bat,Saccopteryx bilineata: species,Salientia: Amphibians,Serpentes: Animals,sexual selection,sharp-tailed gr,sponge isopod,strawberry poison da,Tympanuchus phasianellus: species,Vert,Verteb,Vertebra,Vertebrata},
  number = {4}
